# Jincoin (JIN) peer hints, one per line, in addnode= format
# (host[:port]; port defaults to 23099 if omitted).
#
# This file is consulted by init.sh; non-empty entries are rendered into
# data/jincoin.conf as addnode= directives. Blank lines and lines starting
# with # are ignored.
#
# 2026-05-16: empty. All six DNS seeds in src/chainparams.cpp resolve to
# NXDOMAIN, the project's three domains (jin-coin.com, jin-coin.info,
# jin.exchange) are dead, and the single hardcoded mainnet peer in
# src/chainparamsseeds.h:
#
#     192.52.166.125:23099   # unreachable from multiple vantage points
#
# is unreachable. Adding it as an addnode= is pointless until either it
# comes back online or a private archive surfaces a working peer.
